 "description": [
  "f(x) = 3x − 5 is a straight line of gradient 3, so each output comes from one input.",
  "Solving y = 3x − 5 for x gives f⁻¹(y) = (y + 5)/3.",
  "Its graph is f reflected in y = x, with gradient 1/3.",
  "The curves meet on y = x, at x = 3x − 5, that is x = 2.5."
